{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15476","headline":"暮春寻终南柳处士 · 李端","name":"暮春寻终南柳处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庞眉一居士，鹑服隐尧时。\n种荳初成亩，还丹旧日师。\n入溪花径远，向岭鸟行迟。\n紫葛垂苔壁，青菰映柳丝。\n偶来尘外事，暂与素心期。\n终恨游春宫，同爲岁月悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}